        <mxCell id="c138" value="&lt;i&gt;Selected: E4, whose formula is in the bar and is copied to E8. Outlined: the expected credit loss, $34,106.25, which is 0.77% of the open balance of $4,418,804.32 (coral), and the LossRate column the exercise adds to the Buckets Table, typed as decimals and formatted as percentages (teal). Rows 11 to 13 are the reconciliation of Tutorial 8.2: the opening line of $380,000.00 is in neither the aging nor this estimate.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="386" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
